---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="找不到頁面｜觀夕平台旅遊指南"
  description="這個頁面不存在，請返回觀夕平台旅遊指南首頁或查看交通、最佳時間與安全提醒。"
  noindex
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#173b3f]">
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 size-72 rounded-full bg-[#e98a4a]/20"></div>
    <div class="shell relative z-10 flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col items-start justify-center py-20 text-white">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-[#f5ab78]">404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(3rem,12vw,8rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-.065em]">這一頁退潮了</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-white/65">
        連結可能已經移動，或網址輸入有誤。先回到首頁，再安排前往安平海岸的路。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="button button-sunset" href="/">
          返回首頁
          <Icon name="arrow" class="size-4" />
        </a>
        <a class="button button-light" href="/transport-parking/">查看交通與停車</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
